{"id":"9bb3623b469872d8","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-measure5-pushforward-measure.md","title":"ZFC Measure5 Pushforward Measure","display":"df-zfc-measure5-pushforward-measure — ZFC Measure5 Pushforward Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure5-pushforward-measure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure5-pushforward-measure"],"display":"df-zfc-measure5-pushforward-measure — ZFC Measure5 Pushforward Measure","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-on-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure5-pushforward-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure5-pushforward-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure5-pushforward-measure — ZFC Measure5 Pushforward Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6bcdecbdd77201ee\" href=\"?note=6bcdecbdd77201ee\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-on-space.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-on-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\mu,\\nu,f,E\\in V\">\\(X,Y,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\mu,\\nu,f,E\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableFunction}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableFunction}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasureOnSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasureOnSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6bcdecbdd77201ee\" href=\"?note=6bcdecbdd77201ee\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-on-space.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-on-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5PushforwardMeasure}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5PushforwardMeasure}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure5\\text{-}pushforward\\text{-}measure\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5PushforwardMeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,Y,\\mathcal B,f,\\nu)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableFunction}_S(X,\\mathcal A,Y,\\mathcal B,f)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasureOnSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\land\\nu=\\{\\langle E,\\mu(f^{-1}[E])\\rangle:E\\in\\mathcal B\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure5\\text{-}pushforward\\text{-}measure\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5PushforwardMeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,Y,\\mathcal B,f,\\nu)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableFunction}_S(X,\\mathcal A,Y,\\mathcal B,f)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasureOnSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\land\\nu=\\{\\langle E,\\mu(f^{-1}[E])\\rangle:E\\in\\mathcal B\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure5\\text{-}pushforward\\text{-}measure\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5PushforwardMeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,Y,\\mathcal B,f,\\nu)\\to\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasureOnSpace}_S(Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure5\\text{-}pushforward\\text{-}measure\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5PushforwardMeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,Y,\\mathcal B,f,\\nu)\\to\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasureOnSpace}_S(Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The pushforward measure is defined by inverse images under the map.</li>\n<li>The graph equation is kept inside the guarded predicate, avoiding a partial operator introduced by an implication followed by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\coloneqq\">\\(\\coloneqq\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The argument orders now match the sourced five-place measurable-map predicate and three-place measure-on-space predicate exactly.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-on-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"6bcdecbdd77201ee","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-on-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableFunction}_S:V^5\\to\\{\